<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>CNBC 实时热点</title><link>https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&amp;id=100727362</link><description>CNBC 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:30:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>据英国《金融时报》报道，美国军方本月在英国空军基地击退了无人机</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/28/us-military-repelled-drones-at-uk-airbase-this-month-ft-reports.html</link><description>该报援引知情人士的话称，美国部署了反无人机技术来击退无人机系统。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/28/us-military-repelled-drones-at-uk-airbase-this-month-ft-reports.html'&gt;据英国《金融时报》报道，美国军方本月在英国空军基地击退了无人机&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：U.S. military repelled drones at UK airbase this month, FT reports&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/28/us-military-repelled-drones-at-uk-airbase-this-month-ft-reports.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 07:40:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>非洲首富正在将其大型炼油厂进行重磅IPO</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/28/dangote-refinery-oil-ipo-nigeria-africa-energy.html</link><description>丹格特炼油厂 (Dangote Refinery) 的 IPO 可能使该公司估值约为 470 亿美元，预计将成为非洲最大的股票市场上市交易。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/28/dangote-refinery-oil-ipo-nigeria-africa-energy.html'&gt;非洲首富正在将其大型炼油厂进行重磅IPO&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Africa’s richest man is taking his mega-refinery public in a blockbuster IPO&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/28/dangote-refinery-oil-ipo-nigeria-africa-energy.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:00:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>沙特阿拉伯在经济和安全压力下改变 2030 年愿景支出</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/28/saudi-arabia-vision-2030-spending.